WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.150
- Did y'all do anything like to bond

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.130
while y'all were shooting this?

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:03.963
'Cause it's a trilogy.

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:06.360
I feel like you're like
the Avengers of Hallmark.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.270
This is awesome.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.170
- Oh, we were so excited to be together

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.090
and have this chance,

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:12.160
and we knew each other
in different ways before,

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.520
and now I feel forever bonded to them.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.237
But I mean, everything from,
we'd finish work and be like,

00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:19.400
"Do you wanna come work on some lines

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.900
and have a glass of wine?"

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.380
And that would turn into five hours later

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.620
we'd be in our pajamas,
just having girls' night.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.290
- Love that kind of night.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.469
- I'm not sure, we ran a
lot of lines to be honest.

00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:30.999
(all laughing)

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:33.740
I drank wine and talked about parenting

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.200
and just bonded,

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.260
and had a good time some lot of laughs.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.120
- That's important though
'cause we all are parents

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.210
and it's a hard thing to be a working mom.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.190
- It is. I've learned so
much from these ladies.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:45.570
I have just the utmost
respect so we're very lucky.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.380
- Yeah, yeah, it's a big job.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.670
So Autumn, these guys changed your mind

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.640
about one parenting decision, right?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.000
- They did, they were so
passionate about Disneyland

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.880
and the experience of taking your kids

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.800
to Disneyland.
- [Kelly] Wait.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.180
- Which is something I
hadn't done with my sons yet.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.050
- Wait, what?
- The crowds and the expense

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.500
and they convinced me

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.400
and I took my kids to Disneyland
for New Year's this year.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.360
That was our big New Year's celebration.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.610
- Kelly, we had the exact same reaction.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.590
We were floored.
- And I loved it.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.950
- I feel like Lacey almost
fell out of her chair

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.000
when she found out
- [Lacey] I did.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:14.833
I was like, how have you
never been to Disneyland?

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.787
- [Kelly] That's like where you take kids

00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:17.640
when you're here.
- I'm not judging you

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.210
but, also, how have you
never been to Disneyland?

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.743
- Also yeah, wait, you'd never been?

00:01:21.743 --> 00:01:24.170
- I'd been, but I hadn't taken my kids.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.590
I hadn't taken that big parenting leap.

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:27.423
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:27.423 --> 00:01:28.690
Well, it is a fun parenting leap

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:32.420
because no matter who you
are, you have a meltdown

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.700
with a child at some point during the day.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.533
- [Autumn] Exactly.

00:01:35.533 --> 00:01:36.366
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:36.366 --> 00:01:38.700
And you question so many life decisions.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.533
- Everything.

00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:40.500
- [Kelly] Aha, everything.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.027
And you're like, why are we here?

00:01:42.027 --> 00:01:44.610
And then it's like, why
did I have this idea?

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.910
This is supposed to be fun.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.145
- [Autumn] So much sugar.

00:01:47.145 --> 00:01:48.140
(all laughing)

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.540
- Kind of what if the
sugar is Satan (chuckles).

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.080
- When you see your kids watch "Fantasmic"

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.250
for the first time, I just
still can picture it in my mind.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.810
Like, just the beauty of it

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.030
and the adventure and the
like look on their face.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.470
It was like, I was seven years old again.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.170
- [Kelly] Oh my God, it's magical.

